			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140030101,
					"content": "不好意思，夏洛蒂小姐。今天我和妹妹有点忙，暂时不接受采访…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030102,
					"content": "放心，我只会占用一点点时间——拜托了，林尼先生！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030103,
					"content": "咦，发生什么事了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030104,
					"content": "我原本通宵写好了关于怪盗貂的专栏，今天早上就可以登报发表了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030105,
					"content": "但是——就在凌晨的时候，我突然获知消息，塞萨尔的未婚妻嘉玛主动联系了警备队，承认她才是真正的怪盗貂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030106,
					"content": "这么快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030107,
					"content": "咳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030108,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030109,
					"content": "已经来不及了，哥哥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030110,
					"content": "呵呵…你们的第一反应是「这么快」，看来已经提前知道真相了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030111,
					"content": "啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030112,
					"content": "果然我的直觉是对的，你们绝对有什么事瞒着我！嘉玛投案自首的原因…肯定跟昨晚林尼先生的魔术表演有关！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030113,
					"content": "可能是嘉玛小姐看到高空逃生魔术后，回忆起和塞萨尔共度的时光，良心发现了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030114,
					"content": "原来如此——不对啊，要是这么简单就良心发现，这十年她干什么去了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030115,
					"content": "这个嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030116,
					"content": "（感觉夏洛蒂的记者之魂正在熊熊燃烧，得想办法引开她的注意力…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140030117,
					"content": "我记起来了！昨天的魔术表演后，你们和嘉玛都不见了。难道说就是那个时候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030118,
					"content": "突击采访，请问表演完你们去哪里了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030119,
					"content": "魔术表演完？我们和林尼在墓园，林尼还给我们单独表演了魔术呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030120,
					"content": "说起来，多亏了你的提醒，现在林尼变魔术已经会用「虹彩蔷薇」啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030121,
					"content": "咳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030122,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030123,
					"content": "#印象里就连我也没有收到过哥哥送的虹彩蔷薇。所以哥哥的意思是，{M#他们}{F#她们}比我更重要吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030124,
					"content": "不是啦！这个…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030125,
					"content": "怎、怎么连你也是这个反应，我又说错话了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030126,
					"content": "#气氛好像变得很奇怪…{NICKNAME}，我们现在该怎么办啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030127,
					"content": "唉，看来今天好像不太适合采访。好吧，那我下次再来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030128,
					"content": "请原谅我的固执，但我不会对这么劲爆的消息坐视不理！嘉玛的事情一经传开就引起了巨大轰动，我要全力挖出这背后的真相！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030129,
					"content": "听说她还对警备队讲了「最后的心愿是希望再见洛伦佐一面」。啧…好复杂的关系，真让人好奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030130,
					"content": "总之我先走了。你们慢慢聊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030131,
					"content": "呃，琳妮特，其实…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030132,
					"content": "没事，我并没有生气，刚刚只是为了转移她的注意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030133,
					"content": "原来是这样，吓我一跳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030134,
					"content": "呼，连我也差点被骗到了…好在效果不错，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030135,
					"content": "…虹彩蔷薇，请好好保管。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030136,
					"content": "如果弄丢了的话，我也会感到难过的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}